    notableQuote: `Other features that drive excessive use, emerging risks from AI companions and all that. So, we are actually going to break it down and see how we can improve it.`,
    notableQuoteEn: `Other features that drive excessive use, emerging risks from AI companions and all that. So, we are actually going to break it down and see how we can improve it.`,
