    titleEn: `Alternative Singpass Identity Options Apart from Facial Verification`,
    titleJa: `Singpass顔認証に代わる本人確認手段`,
    titleKo: `Singpass 얼굴 인식 외 대체 본인 인증 수단`,
    title: `Singpass面部识别替代验证方案`,
    date: '2026-02-12',
    parliament: '15',
    type: 'Oral Answers to Questions',
    speakers: ['Denise Phua Lay Peng', 'Jasmin Lau'],
