    id: 'oral-answer-4013',
    titleEn: `Headcount Retention and Technology Transfer for Citizen Workforce of Singapore-based AI Company Recently Acquired by Meta`,
    title: `AI企业收购与本地人才保障`,
    titleKo: `AI 기업 인수와 현지 인재 보호`,
