    id: 'oral-answer-1902',
    titleEn: `Review of Public Agencies Exemption Provisions in Personal Data Protection Act`,
    title: `公共机构数据保护豁免审议`,
    titleKo: `공공기관 데이터 보호 면제 조항 심의`,
    titleJa: `公共機関のデータ保護適用除外の審議`,
    date: '2019-02-12',
    parliament: '13',
    type: 'Oral Answers to Questions',
